To run a Python script that calls the Anthropic API in a web browser, we need Streamlit (Easiest)

1-pip install streamlit anthropic python-dotenv

2- create app.py

3-for the run
streamlit run app.py

Most IMP :- after diconnect run again
Is Streamlit still running? If you accidentally stopped Streamlit, just restart it in your terminal:

streamlit run yourscript.py
